  "notes": "Compulsory schooling starts in the calendar year a child turns 7. The 8-year primary school has classes I–VIII; secondary classes are numbered afresh: liceum ogólnokształcące has 4, technikum 5 (a fifth year beyond this list) and branżowa szkoła I stopnia 3."
